{"ep": "28", "idx": 0, "start": "0:00:09.76", "end": "0:00:13.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "文化祭和之后做的那些理也理不清的杂事结束之后"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 1, "start": "0:00:14.12", "end": "0:00:17.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "很快地  能够听见在冬天的脚步声伴随着山风一起到来的现在"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 2, "start": "0:00:17.96", "end": "0:00:19.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "已经是快到12月了"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 3, "start": "0:00:20.28", "end": "0:00:23.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "夸耀着和学校同龄的古老的这座社团教室大楼"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 4, "start": "0:00:24.15", "end": "0:00:26.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "由于墙壁太过单薄"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 5, "start": "0:00:26.60", "end": "0:00:30.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "即使在室内  也会感觉有些寒冷"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 6, "start": "0:02:45.45", "end": "0:02:48.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "每次都会被卷入各种各样事件的SOS团"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 7, "start": "0:02:48.88", "end": "0:02:51.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说起来其实主要都是集中在我身上"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 8, "start": "0:02:51.95", "end": "0:02:55.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是这种事也不是每天都会一定会遇上"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 9, "start": "0:02:56.14", "end": "0:03:00.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而且如果每天都有这样那样的超常事件炸弹爆炸的话"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 10, "start": "0:03:00.89", "end": "0:03:03.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我的身体也会支撑不住  心灵更是早就该崩溃了"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 11, "start": "0:03:10.07", "end": "0:03:11.64", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（圣诞节恋爱占卜  去寻找幸福吧！圣诞特辑）"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 12, "start": "0:03:10.07", "end": "0:03:12.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是  春日不在的时候"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 13, "start": "0:03:12.44", "end": "0:03:14.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是安静得令人高兴呢"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 14, "start": "0:03:16.90", "end": "0:03:19.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可是…是不是太安静了点？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 15, "start": "0:03:26.30", "end": "0:03:31.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "仔细想想  遇到春日和朝比奈学姐以来已经半年了吗？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 16, "start": "0:03:34.08", "end": "0:03:35.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是经历了不少事"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 17, "start": "0:03:36.17", "end": "0:03:37.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然很多的起因都是春日"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 18, "start": "0:03:38.20", "end": "0:03:40.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但也有些并非如此的呢"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 19, "start": "0:03:40.21", "end": "0:03:44.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不过呢  基本上都是在我们悠闲地品味生活时"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 20, "start": "0:03:45.26", "end": "0:03:47.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那家伙突然冲进来而开始…"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 21, "start": "0:03:47.63", "end": "0:03:50.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "各位！听我说  有好消息哦！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 22, "start": "0:03:50.99", "end": "0:03:52.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "又来了…"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 23, "start": "0:03:52.46", "end": "0:03:54.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这家伙嘴里说的好消息"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 24, "start": "0:03:54.55", "end": "0:04:01.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对于我们  特别是我和朝比奈学姐来说  真的是好消息的例子几乎没有"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 25, "start": "0:04:01.80", "end": "0:04:02.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这次又是什么事啊"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 26, "start": "0:04:03.22", "end": "0:04:06.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可以在社团教室里面装暖气设备了！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 27, "start": "0:04:10.44", "end": "0:04:11.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  来了来了"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 28, "start": "0:04:12.54", "end": "0:04:17.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "拍电影的时候做过赞助商的那个电器店  说会为我们提供设备"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 29, "start": "0:04:17.67", "end": "0:04:21.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说是有去年卖剩下的电暖气  囤积在仓库里一直忘记了"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 30, "start": "0:04:21.20", "end": "0:04:23.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "处理掉觉得可惜  如果我们愿意就可以拿去用"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 31, "start": "0:04:23.65", "end": "0:04:25.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "刚才打电话来说的"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 32, "start": "0:04:25.68", "end": "0:04:31.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这世界上应该没有会闲到特地打电话\n给春日说这种事的亲切电器商"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 33, "start": "0:04:31.59", "end": "0:04:33.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以估计又是这家伙去强要的吧"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 34, "start": "0:04:34.15", "end": "0:04:35.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因此呢  阿虚"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 35, "start": "0:04:35.39", "end": "0:04:37.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你现在去店里把它拿回来"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 36, "start": "0:04:38.05", "end": "0:04:39.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我去？现在？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 37, "start": "0:04:39.75", "end": "0:04:41.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对  你现在就去"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 38, "start": "0:04:42.40", "end": "0:04:46.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我说你啊  是打算让我把每天都来回往返的那段坡道再下去一次"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 39, "start": "0:04:46.97", "end": "0:04:49.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而且还要去再坐两站电车才能到的电器店"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 40, "start": "0:04:49.86", "end": "0:04:53.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还要再搬着东西回来这里吗？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 41, "start": "0:04:53.22", "end": "0:04:57.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对啊  因为如果你不快去的话  说不定那个大叔就改主意了呢"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 42, "start": "0:04:57.47", "end": "0:04:59.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好了好了  快点给我去！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 43, "start": "0:04:59.48", "end": "0:05:00.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "反正你很闲吧"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 44, "start": "0:05:01.14", "end": "0:05:04.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然我觉得进了这间屋子的人没有一个不闲的"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 45, "start": "0:05:06.68", "end": "0:05:08.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你难道就不闲吗？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 46, "start": "0:05:08.53", "end": "0:05:11.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我之后还有必须要做的事情"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 47, "start": "0:05:14.49", "end": "0:05:17.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "古泉是副团长  而你只是平头团员"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 48, "start": "0:05:17.85", "end": "0:05:21.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不论哪个组织都是等级较低的人要做更重的工作"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 49, "start": "0:05:21.58", "end": "0:05:24.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "当然SOS团也采用了这种规则"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 50, "start": "0:05:25.02", "end": "0:05:30.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "算了吧  这次总算还是个能理解的正经任务"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 51, "start": "0:05:27.89", "end": "0:05:29.08", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我知道了  我去"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 52, "start": "0:05:29.46", "end": "0:05:31.05", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "请小心点"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 53, "start": "0:05:30.56", "end": "0:05:33.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "正好也想在社团教室里装个暖气"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 54, "start": "0:05:31.25", "end": "0:05:33.25", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  我也和你一起去吧"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 55, "start": "0:05:33.31", "end": "0:05:34.37", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠就不用了"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 56, "start": "0:05:34.15", "end": "0:05:36.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "与其推给朝比奈学姐或者长门"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 57, "start": "0:05:34.59", "end": "0:05:35.37", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "留在这里吧"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 58, "start": "0:05:35.66", "end": "0:05:38.62", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这种杂活可以说就是他的使命"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 59, "start": "0:05:36.43", "end": "0:05:37.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还不如我自己去"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 60, "start": "0:05:38.99", "end": "0:05:39.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哦…"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 61, "start": "0:05:44.78", "end": "0:05:45.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "等一下"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 62, "start": "0:05:48.39", "end": "0:05:50.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今天很冷呢"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 63, "start": "0:05:52.88", "end": "0:05:53.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谢谢"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 64, "start": "0:05:53.76", "end": "0:05:55.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "动作快点！快去啊！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 65, "start": "0:06:20.69", "end": "0:06:22.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好了  碍事的人也走了"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 66, "start": "0:06:23.04", "end": "0:06:23.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "咦？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 67, "start": "0:06:23.69", "end": "0:06:26.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠  我要拍几张照片  来摆些POSE吧～"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 68, "start": "0:06:26.73", "end": "0:06:27.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "咦～？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 69, "start": "0:06:27.36", "end": "0:06:29.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "请  请问是什么照片？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 70, "start": "0:06:29.67", "end": "0:06:34.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还用说吗？当然是因为文化祭的时候上映的\n「朝比奈实玖瑠的冒险」要做成DVD"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 71, "start": "0:06:35.02", "end": "0:06:36.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以要拍照片作封面啊！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 72, "start": "0:06:36.60", "end": "0:06:39.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "咦…真的要做出来吗…？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 73, "start": "0:06:40.46", "end": "0:06:42.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你不是放弃了么…"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 74, "start": "0:06:42.39", "end": "0:06:44.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为那个时候阿虚太罗嗦了"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 75, "start": "0:06:44.90", "end": "0:06:47.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在就不会有人反对了吧～"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 76, "start": "0:06:49.16", "end": "0:06:49.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 77, "start": "0:06:52.42", "end": "0:06:56.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "刚开始爬这条坡路上学的时候可是厌烦得要命"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 78, "start": "0:06:56.94", "end": "0:06:59.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是经过了半年之后  也已经完全适应了"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 79, "start": "0:07:00.31", "end": "0:07:02.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不论是像徒步旅行路线的上下学"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 80, "start": "0:07:02.97", "end": "0:07:05.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还是SOS团…"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 81, "start": "0:07:10.25", "end": "0:07:14.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在  春日又趁我不在的时候在社团教室做什么呢？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 82, "start": "0:07:14.77", "end": "0:07:16.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "希望不是说着因为无聊或者别的什么"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 83, "start": "0:07:16.90", "end": "0:07:19.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就肆意玩弄朝比奈学姐就好了…"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 84, "start": "0:07:20.27", "end": "0:07:22.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "古泉  拿反光板的任务就交给你了哦"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 85, "start": "0:07:22.85", "end": "0:07:23.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我知道了"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 86, "start": "0:07:24.07", "end": "0:07:27.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠  别发呆了  快摆POSE啊！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 87, "start": "0:07:27.40", "end": "0:07:28.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "快点快点"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 88, "start": "0:07:28.52", "end": "0:07:30.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好  好的…"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 89, "start": "0:07:31.70", "end": "0:07:33.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "笑得再有诱惑力一点！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 90, "start": "0:07:34.30", "end": "0:07:35.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "表现出「想要」的样子！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 91, "start": "0:07:36.95", "end": "0:07:39.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这种程度勾引不到男人啦！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 92, "start": "0:07:40.27", "end": "0:07:41.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "呜…"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 93, "start": "0:07:50.95", "end": "0:07:52.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也该换身衣服了吧"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 94, "start": "0:07:52.98", "end": "0:07:54.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "接下来是这个！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 95, "start": "0:07:54.32", "end": "0:07:55.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "咦…"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 96, "start": "0:07:55.29", "end": "0:07:56.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好了好了～"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 97, "start": "0:07:59.96", "end": "0:08:01.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "快放手！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 98, "start": "0:08:03.98", "end": "0:08:06.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我自己会换的——"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 99, "start": "0:08:06.78", "end": "0:08:09.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没关系啦！我帮你换比较快"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 100, "start": "0:08:10.53", "end": "0:08:12.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "咦？连胸罩也要一起…？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 101, "start": "0:08:12.90", "end": "0:08:14.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "反正也要脱下来  没关系吧！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 102, "start": "0:08:14.57", "end": "0:08:17.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  实玖瑠  你的是不是又变大了？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 103, "start": "0:08:17.28", "end": "0:08:18.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "越来越爆了耶"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 104, "start": "0:08:19.10", "end": "0:08:22.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不是…你你你你在摸哪里啊！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 105, "start": "0:08:25.95", "end": "0:08:28.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  已经凉了呢"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 106, "start": "0:08:36.15", "end": "0:08:38.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "呜…好冷…"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 107, "start": "0:08:38.60", "end": "0:08:41.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而且好害羞哦…"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 108, "start": "0:08:41.17", "end": "0:08:44.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠  你应该更有自信一点"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 109, "start": "0:08:44.40", "end": "0:08:48.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不管怎么说  你可是我亲自挑出来的学校里第一的吉祥物角色啊～"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 110, "start": "0:08:48.65", "end": "0:08:49.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对吧？古泉"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 111, "start": "0:08:49.89", "end": "0:08:51.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是说得太对了"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 112, "start": "0:08:51.73", "end": "0:08:53.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么接下来穿这个吧～"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 113, "start": "0:08:54.30", "end": "0:08:55.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "又要…？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 114, "start": "0:08:55.45", "end": "0:08:56.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "No～～～！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 115, "start": "0:08:56.85", "end": "0:08:58.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所  所以那个  我自己来…"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 116, "start": "0:09:02.63", "end": "0:09:04.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "必须要在今天之内拍完"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 117, "start": "0:09:05.00", "end": "0:09:06.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以要抓紧时间！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 118, "start": "0:09:16.10", "end": "0:09:17.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好  接下来是这个"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 119, "start": "0:09:17.75", "end": "0:09:18.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个…"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 120, "start": "0:09:18.99", "end": "0:09:20.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不论是这件护士服还是那一件"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 121, "start": "0:09:21.03", "end": "0:09:24.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "都没有在电影里出现…"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 122, "start": "0:09:24.62", "end": "0:09:28.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这真的是为了DVD封面拍摄的吗？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 123, "start": "0:09:28.34", "end": "0:09:29.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯  是啊"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 124, "start": "0:09:29.61", "end": "0:09:31.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是现在我突然有了一个主意"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 125, "start": "0:09:31.95", "end": "0:09:34.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "拍了这么多都可以编成写真集了呢！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 126, "start": "0:09:34.60", "end": "0:09:36.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个主意你觉得怎么样？古泉"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 127, "start": "0:09:37.00", "end": "0:09:38.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我想这真是个好主意"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 128, "start": "0:09:39.07", "end": "0:09:40.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不…"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 129, "start": "0:09:40.20", "end": "0:09:41.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  等一下"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 130, "start": "0:09:41.27", "end": "0:09:42.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "反正要做DVD"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 131, "start": "0:09:42.86", "end": "0:09:45.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就应该拍些附赠影像出来呢！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 132, "start": "0:09:45.43", "end": "0:09:47.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "古泉  你觉得这个主意怎么样？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 133, "start": "0:09:47.58", "end": "0:09:49.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是个异常好的主意呢"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 134, "start": "0:09:49.37", "end": "0:09:50.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "咦——"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 135, "start": "0:09:53.25", "end": "0:09:57.06", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "电车即将进站"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 136, "start": "0:10:01.20", "end": "0:10:02.23", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来  把背面转向我"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 137, "start": "0:10:02.74", "end": "0:10:05.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看起来恐怕要下雨了呢"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 138, "start": "0:10:05.46", "end": "0:10:06.29", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来  把这个戴上"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 139, "start": "0:10:07.19", "end": "0:10:08.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是好奇怪哦"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 140, "start": "0:10:08.33", "end": "0:10:09.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么了？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 141, "start": "0:10:09.23", "end": "0:10:10.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "他吓了一跳"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 142, "start": "0:10:13.22", "end": "0:10:14.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好了  快脱下来快脱下来！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 143, "start": "0:10:15.38", "end": "0:10:17.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "咦～还要继续吗…"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 144, "start": "0:10:16.13", "end": "0:10:17.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你不想脱吗～？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 145, "start": "0:10:26.20", "end": "0:10:28.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不用脱这个也可以了啦！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 146, "start": "0:10:28.26", "end": "0:10:31.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这是要放在店头的  所以当然不能有这个啦～"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 147, "start": "0:10:31.29", "end": "0:10:35.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "顺利的相会～这轮回的记忆～"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 148, "start": "0:10:36.96", "end": "0:10:38.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真高兴～"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 149, "start": "0:10:41.41", "end": "0:10:43.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个就是约好要给你们的电暖气"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 150, "start": "0:10:44.32", "end": "0:10:45.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "能拿得回去吗？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 151, "start": "0:10:45.74", "end": "0:10:47.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  我会想办法的"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 152, "start": "0:10:47.95", "end": "0:10:50.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那些可爱的女孩子们还好吧？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 153, "start": "0:10:51.06", "end": "0:10:53.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "其中有一个因为太有精神了  弄得我很麻烦呢"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 154, "start": "0:10:54.16", "end": "0:10:55.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "广告的效果表现出来了吗？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 155, "start": "0:10:56.32", "end": "0:10:58.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说实话  和以前没什么变化呢"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 156, "start": "0:10:59.30", "end": "0:11:03.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说来也是啊  高中文化祭上的电影中间插入的广告"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 157, "start": "0:11:04.23", "end": "0:11:05.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "局限性也太大了"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 158, "start": "0:11:06.18", "end": "0:11:08.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "居然还真能拉到赞助商啊"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 159, "start": "0:11:08.48", "end": "0:11:12.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说起来  那个很精神的女孩子在电话里对我说"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 160, "start": "0:11:12.94", "end": "0:11:15.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还要拍电影的续篇  是真的吗？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 161, "start": "0:11:16.32", "end": "0:11:19.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果那家伙这么说了  估计就真的会拍了"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 162, "start": "0:11:19.56", "end": "0:11:22.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "她拜托我继续赞助呢"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 163, "start": "0:11:24.11", "end": "0:11:28.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个电暖气就当作是下次赞助的前金吧"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 164, "start": "0:11:28.66", "end": "0:11:30.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "原来是耍了这种伎俩啊…"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 165, "start": "0:11:30.73", "end": "0:11:31.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么我就告辞了"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 166, "start": "0:11:33.19", "end": "0:11:34.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谢谢您"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 167, "start": "0:11:34.61", "end": "0:11:35.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  路上小心"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 168, "start": "0:11:42.22", "end": "0:11:45.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "水黾水黾  好红好红  a i u e o"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 169, "start": "0:11:45.94", "end": "0:11:49.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在浮藻里  小虾也在  游啊游着泳"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 170, "start": "0:11:50.13", "end": "0:11:53.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "柿子的树  栗子的树  ka ki ku ke ko"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 171, "start": "0:11:54.43", "end": "0:11:58.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有啄木鸟  在咯咯地  啄着枯榉树"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 172, "start": "0:11:59.20", "end": "0:12:02.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在豇豆上  浇上点醋  sa shi su se so"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 173, "start": "0:12:04.54", "end": "0:12:09.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那条小鱼  在浅滩处  被人刺中了"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 174, "start": "0:12:10.53", "end": "0:12:16.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "站起来吧  喇叭出来  ta chi tsu te to"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 175, "start": "0:12:16.66", "end": "0:12:17.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "下一个是to to！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 176, "start": "0:12:17.80", "end": "0:12:21.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啪唧啪唧  啪啪啪地  飞起来啦～！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 177, "start": "0:12:21.56", "end": "0:12:27.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一个蛞蝓  蠕动蠕动  na ni nu ne no"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 178, "start": "0:12:28.78", "end": "0:12:32.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯～你就是犯人"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 179, "start": "0:12:32.85", "end": "0:12:35.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "唔  红方选择了14号"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 180, "start": "0:12:35.56", "end": "0:12:36.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯～没关系  也好"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 181, "start": "0:12:37.21", "end": "0:12:38.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "接下来究竟会有怎样的发展呢？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 182, "start": "0:12:38.75", "end": "0:12:39.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "请开始下一个问题"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 183, "start": "0:12:40.15", "end": "0:12:43.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好厉害…那孩子刚一出来  舞台上的气氛就变了！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 184, "start": "0:12:44.66", "end": "0:12:47.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而且那个孩子…和之前完全不一样"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 185, "start": "0:12:47.44", "end": "0:12:49.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "比起刚才  简直像是换了个人似的"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 186, "start": "0:12:50.13", "end": "0:12:52.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是个可怕的孩子呀"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 187, "start": "0:12:52.70", "end": "0:12:54.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "汤面定食！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 188, "start": "0:12:55.06", "end": "0:12:56.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "炒饭定食！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 189, "start": "0:12:57.51", "end": "0:12:59.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "炸虾大碗盖饭定食！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 190, "start": "0:13:00.50", "end": "0:13:02.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "青年A（Ace）！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 191, "start": "0:13:02.93", "end": "0:13:04.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "中年A（Ace）！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 192, "start": "0:13:04.97", "end": "0:13:06.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "定年A（Ace）！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 193, "start": "0:13:04.97", "end": "0:13:06.43", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（定年是退休年龄的意思）"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 194, "start": "0:13:06.79", "end": "0:13:08.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "留年A（Ace）！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 195, "start": "0:13:06.79", "end": "0:13:08.33", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（留年即留级）"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 196, "start": "0:13:08.56", "end": "0:13:10.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来年A（Ace）！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 197, "start": "0:13:08.56", "end": "0:13:10.18", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（来年即明年）"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 198, "start": "0:13:10.33", "end": "0:13:11.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "残年A（Ace）！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 199, "start": "0:13:10.33", "end": "0:13:11.88", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（残年是余生的意思，这里也可以当作是“残念”（遗憾的意思））"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 200, "start": "0:13:12.24", "end": "0:13:15.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "果然还是喜欢啊…A（Ace）！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 201, "start": "0:13:15.91", "end": "0:13:17.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么不能做到最好！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 202, "start": "0:13:17.85", "end": "0:13:19.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "给我努力！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 203, "start": "0:13:19.72", "end": "0:13:23.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你们想说的话已经被我完全彻底一点不剩地看透了！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 204, "start": "0:13:23.92", "end": "0:13:25.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看起来像个小孩  内部却很奇怪"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 205, "start": "0:13:26.09", "end": "0:13:29.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "镇子上强有力的伙伴  他的名字就是  名侦探——！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 206, "start": "0:13:30.49", "end": "0:13:36.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嘿～让开让开让开！你们没有看到这个家徽吗！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 207, "start": "0:13:36.83", "end": "0:13:43.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为  我是法国的  女王～～呀！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 208, "start": "0:13:43.52", "end": "0:13:45.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不要被打中奇怪的地方啊！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 209, "start": "0:13:45.65", "end": "0:13:46.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你还太嫩了啊"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 210, "start": "0:14:01.21", "end": "0:14:04.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "大家好～我们是Ice Candies！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 211, "start": "0:14:04.66", "end": "0:14:05.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯…"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 212, "start": "0:14:05.79", "end": "0:14:08.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "小Yuki～你还是那么性感啊～"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 213, "start": "0:14:08.50", "end": "0:14:10.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在看哪里啊你这色鬼  我可要叫警察了！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 214, "start": "0:14:10.69", "end": "0:14:11.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "突然就给了我一记下钩拳？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 215, "start": "0:14:11.85", "end": "0:14:14.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我就好像是在环状线电车上被误当作色狼呢"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 216, "start": "0:14:14.47", "end": "0:14:15.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说起来已经到冬天了呢"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 217, "start": "0:14:15.86", "end": "0:14:17.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对～是冬天了～一说起冬天——"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 218, "start": "0:14:17.83", "end": "0:14:19.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你还真是罗嗦啊"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 219, "start": "0:14:19.08", "end": "0:14:20.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "又来一拳  真是厉害啊  小Yuki"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 220, "start": "0:14:20.77", "end": "0:14:22.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "WBC也会邀请你加入吧！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 221, "start": "0:14:22.34", "end": "0:14:25.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真期待会不会有候补人选和我搭档"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 222, "start": "0:14:25.54", "end": "0:14:27.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你的期待可真阴沉！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 223, "start": "0:14:28.06", "end": "0:14:31.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "呃…你看  这不是很快就要到圣诞节了吗"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 224, "start": "0:14:31.17", "end": "0:14:32.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有点想吃火锅了"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 225, "start": "0:14:32.87", "end": "0:14:34.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对！说到冬天就是火锅了！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 226, "start": "0:14:34.71", "end": "0:14:36.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你喜欢在火锅里放些什么？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 227, "start": "0:14:36.18", "end": "0:14:41.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "呃…这个嘛  比如白菜啊  鸡肉  菌类…纳豆…豆腐…呃…"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 228, "start": "0:14:41.26", "end": "0:14:41.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "小Yuki呢？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 229, "start": "0:14:41.87", "end": "0:14:42.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "熊肉"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 230, "start": "0:14:42.64", "end": "0:14:44.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哇——！小Yuki是猎人啊！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 231, "start": "0:14:44.97", "end": "0:14:46.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我还是赶快逃跑吧！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 232, "start": "0:14:46.69", "end": "0:14:50.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不过一想到熊的感受  就会觉得它太可怜了  吃不下去"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 233, "start": "0:14:50.35", "end": "0:14:52.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那你最初就不要把熊肉放进锅里去"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 234, "start": "0:14:52.71", "end": "0:14:54.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我来扮演那个在滚汤里煮的熊肉"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 235, "start": "0:14:54.65", "end": "0:14:55.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "咦？小Yuki来演？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 236, "start": "0:14:55.59", "end": "0:14:57.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以你扮演锅吧"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 237, "start": "0:14:57.21", "end": "0:14:58.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "又来了！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 238, "start": "0:14:58.55", "end": "0:15:00.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还要最…"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 239, "start": "0:15:00.64", "end": "0:15:01.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哟  阿虚"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 240, "start": "0:15:01.85", "end": "0:15:03.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你在这种地方干什么呢？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 241, "start": "0:15:03.83", "end": "0:15:05.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你看不出来么？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 242, "start": "0:15:05.36", "end": "0:15:06.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在搬东西"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 243, "start": "0:15:06.49", "end": "0:15:08.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嘿  还真是辛苦你了"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 244, "start": "0:15:08.67", "end": "0:15:10.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "反正又是凉宫的命令吧"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 245, "start": "0:15:10.91", "end": "0:15:16.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看来经过了半年  同学们对我的处境已经十分了解了"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 246, "start": "0:15:16.64", "end": "0:15:18.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在还要回学校去吗？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 247, "start": "0:15:18.44", "end": "0:15:19.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真的很辛苦呢"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 248, "start": "0:15:20.23", "end": "0:15:21.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就是啊"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 249, "start": "0:15:21.39", "end": "0:15:21.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "再见啦"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 250, "start": "0:15:22.19", "end": "0:15:22.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哦"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 251, "start": "0:15:22.86", "end": "0:15:23.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明天见"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 252, "start": "0:15:23.67", "end": "0:15:24.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 253, "start": "0:15:30.09", "end": "0:15:32.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "切  真下起来了"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 254, "start": "0:15:32.94", "end": "0:15:36.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "天气预报明明说降水概率10%的"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 255, "start": "0:15:36.46", "end": "0:15:38.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是个胡说八道的气象预报员"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 256, "start": "0:15:38.87", "end": "0:15:40.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "希望别下得太大"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 257, "start": "0:15:44.47", "end": "0:15:46.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哎呀？下起雨来了"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 258, "start": "0:15:47.06", "end": "0:15:48.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚没事吧…"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 259, "start": "0:15:50.01", "end": "0:15:52.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "之前的我没有比现在更留恋那间房子了吧"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 260, "start": "0:15:53.21", "end": "0:15:56.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只是想尽快喝到朝比奈学姐泡的热茶"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 261, "start": "0:15:57.25", "end": "0:15:59.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好温暖我的身心"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 262, "start": "0:16:00.45", "end": "0:16:01.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗨～"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 263, "start": "0:16:01.80", "end": "0:16:02.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠在吗？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 264, "start": "0:16:03.13", "end": "0:16:05.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…咦？只有小长门啊"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 265, "start": "0:16:06.44", "end": "0:16:09.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我想和她交换明天的值日"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 266, "start": "0:16:09.45", "end": "0:16:11.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以才来找她的…"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 267, "start": "0:16:11.41", "end": "0:16:12.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠呢？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 268, "start": "0:16:13.66", "end": "0:16:16.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哦  在那边吗  谢了"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 269, "start": "0:16:51.17", "end": "0:16:52.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哎呀哎呀"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 270, "start": "0:16:54.41", "end": "0:16:57.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哎呀呀  阿虚出去办事了？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 271, "start": "0:16:57.14", "end": "0:16:57.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "鹤屋学姐"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 272, "start": "0:16:57.90", "end": "0:16:58.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "难怪呢"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 273, "start": "0:16:59.38", "end": "0:17:00.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么事？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 274, "start": "0:17:00.94", "end": "0:17:03.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没什么啦～辛苦你了"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 275, "start": "0:17:03.95", "end": "0:17:05.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喔  都淋湿了"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 276, "start": "0:17:08.27", "end": "0:17:08.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谢谢你"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 277, "start": "0:17:09.37", "end": "0:17:10.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "再见了"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 278, "start": "0:17:10.38", "end": "0:17:13.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "手帕一会儿和这个一起交给实玖瑠就好"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 279, "start": "0:17:14.25", "end": "0:17:17.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "和以前一样  还是一个无法掌握行动的人"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 280, "start": "0:17:17.31", "end": "0:17:19.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但依旧是个亲切的好学姐"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 281, "start": "0:17:27.65", "end": "0:17:31.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "咦？…长门  只有你在啊"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 282, "start": "0:17:39.96", "end": "0:17:40.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "春日她们呢？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 283, "start": "0:17:49.08", "end": "0:17:51.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没错！这里就应该坐上去！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 284, "start": "0:17:52.06", "end": "0:17:53.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你很明白嘛！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 285, "start": "0:17:59.47", "end": "0:18:00.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  好痛！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 286, "start": "0:18:01.01", "end": "0:18:01.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "咪…"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 287, "start": "0:18:01.69", "end": "0:18:03.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个笨拙女孩的样子实在是太惹人喜爱了！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 288, "start": "0:18:03.82", "end": "0:18:05.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你该不会是故意装出来的吧？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 289, "start": "0:18:05.45", "end": "0:18:07.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "古泉  帮我拿一下这个"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 290, "start": "0:18:09.25", "end": "0:18:10.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "应该这样  这样！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 291, "start": "0:18:16.23", "end": "0:18:20.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然有些介意他们三个现在到底去哪里做什么了"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 292, "start": "0:18:20.72", "end": "0:18:24.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是抱着那么重的东西爬坡实在是把我打垮了"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 293, "start": "0:18:24.74", "end": "0:18:29.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而且这条路在放学回家的时候\n还必须再走一遍  真是郁闷啊"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 294, "start": "0:18:37.12", "end": "0:18:38.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来吧来吧来吧来吧来吧"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 295, "start": "0:18:40.13", "end": "0:18:42.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊～手好冷啊…"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 296, "start": "0:19:18.70", "end": "0:19:19.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "累死了…"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 297, "start": "0:20:16.22", "end": "0:20:16.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊…"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 298, "start": "0:20:17.56", "end": "0:20:18.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只有你一个人啊？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 299, "start": "0:20:19.02", "end": "0:20:20.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么了  不行吗？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 300, "start": "0:20:21.87", "end": "0:20:23.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不是不行…"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 301, "start": "0:20:24.00", "end": "0:20:27.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你该不会对我的脸做了什么恶作剧吧？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 302, "start": "0:20:27.69", "end": "0:20:30.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我才不会做这种幼稚的事呢"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 303, "start": "0:20:30.90", "end": "0:20:32.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "其他三人呢？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 304, "start": "0:20:32.76", "end": "0:20:33.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "已经先回家去了"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 305, "start": "0:20:34.12", "end": "0:20:36.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "都是因为你总是睡不醒…"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 306, "start": "0:20:36.59", "end": "0:20:39.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以你就留下来了吗？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 307, "start": "0:20:39.68", "end": "0:20:40.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没办法啊"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 308, "start": "0:20:41.17", "end": "0:20:45.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你一直在睡  又必须有人把社团教室的门锁上"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 309, "start": "0:20:45.26", "end": "0:20:47.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而且还下着雨"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 310, "start": "0:20:49.62", "end": "0:20:50.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还给我吧"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 311, "start": "0:20:51.40", "end": "0:20:51.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 312, "start": "0:20:52.11", "end": "0:20:53.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "毛线外套"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 313, "start": "0:20:53.38", "end": "0:20:55.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  哦…"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 314, "start": "0:21:06.25", "end": "0:21:08.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一件是春日的没错"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 315, "start": "0:21:09.01", "end": "0:21:12.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是  另一件是谁的？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 316, "start": "0:21:15.07", "end": "0:21:16.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…等一下  这也就是说"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 317, "start": "0:21:17.20", "end": "0:21:20.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "朝比奈学姐在睡着的我身边换了衣服？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 318, "start": "0:21:20.31", "end": "0:21:23.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可恶！为什么睡得这么死！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 319, "start": "0:21:23.22", "end": "0:21:24.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果只是装作睡着的话…！"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 320, "start": "0:21:25.02", "end": "0:21:27.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好了  早就到了该回家的时候了"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 321, "start": "0:21:27.26", "end": "0:21:28.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们也回去吧"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 322, "start": "0:21:28.90", "end": "0:21:29.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 323, "start": "0:21:30.87", "end": "0:21:34.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是真糟糕啊  我没带雨伞"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 324, "start": "0:21:34.43", "end": "0:21:36.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有一把就够了吧"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 325, "start": "0:21:39.67", "end": "0:21:43.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "再往这边靠一点啦  我都淋到了"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 326, "start": "0:21:44.03", "end": "0:21:45.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "已经靠过去很多了啊"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 327, "start": "0:21:46.29", "end": "0:21:49.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  这把伞不是你的对吧？"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 328, "start": "0:21:49.85", "end": "0:21:51.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "上面写着「教职员工用」呢"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 329, "start": "0:21:52.16", "end": "0:21:53.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "反正是学校的预备品"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 330, "start": "0:21:53.97", "end": "0:21:56.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "让学生用一下也没什么不好吧"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 331, "start": "0:21:56.91", "end": "0:21:59.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么了？如果你想淋着雨回去的话"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 332, "start": "0:21:59.76", "end": "0:22:00.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我就不给你打了～"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 333, "start": "0:22:02.11", "end": "0:22:02.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是的"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 334, "start": "0:22:03.39", "end": "0:22:05.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我都把电暖气搬来了…"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 335, "start": "0:22:06.18", "end": "0:22:07.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "连句慰劳的话都不说吗"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 336, "start": "0:22:08.18", "end": "0:22:09.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个团长大人啊"}
{"ep": "28", "idx": 337, "start": "0:22:11.22", "end": "0:22:12.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "等一下啦！"}
